<h1 id="health-coach">Health Coach</h1>
<p>Health Coach currently provides a basic dashboard. There are plans to expand the service, but personalised health coaching and LLM-driven recommendations are not part of its current functionality.</p>
<p>The service follows the earlier exploratory project <a href="/documentation/services/aihc">AI Health Coach</a>.</p>
<h2 id="architecture-overview">Architecture Overview</h2>
<p>The dashboard has a frontend and a backend deployed on ECS Fargate, backed by a PostgreSQL database hosted on Amazon RDS.</p>
<p>The frontend configuration supplies the API URL. The user&rsquo;s browser sends requests directly to the backend, which handles application logic and database access.</p>
<p><a href="/images/healthcoach-architecture.png" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/healthcoach-architecture.png" alt="Health Coach architecture diagram" /></a></p>
