<li><a href="https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/healthcoach-platform-backend">healthcoach-platform-backend</a>: backend API.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="infrastructure-as-code-iac">Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/healthcoach-platform-iac">healthcoach-platform-iac</a>: Terraform configuration for the service&rsquo;s AWS infrastructure.</li>
</ul>
